  "findings": [
    "Unmodified published beta did not activate on the pinned DSH tool-role result; the digest-bound adapter fixes that recorded protocol difference.",
    "Without pause intent context, the model may attempt to undo a pause or spend a turn investigating it; the adapted native GoalBar sends the actual user action to a busy model without waking an idle session.",
    "LoopX onboarding can be missed by a model; initialization guidance requests exact thread-binding readback.",
    "Optional Explore and Reward Memory CLIs are installed, but separate providers or memory services are not provisioned.",
    "This acceptance does not certify production deployment, Docker isolation, clinical superiority, or equal-budget benchmark gains."
